=== WHAT THIS PROVES (the pinned negative path) ===
Deploying on a GPU arch the tuning DB has NO validated entry for must fail GRACEFULLY:
/predict's detect->select gate (the reused Runtime design) returns a clear, actionable
"no tuned kernel ...; run the autotuner" error (HTTP 404). It must NEVER serve a wrong
kernel (a sibling arch's or a different shape's variant) and NEVER crash. The selection
entry is None on a miss (the launcher / engine is never invoked) - asserted below, exactly
as the GPU-free C++ gtest runtime.MissReturnsClearErrorAndDoesNotServe asserts launcher.calls==0.

The tuning DB below holds an A10 (sm_86) VALIDATED entry for fused_matmul_bias_gelu
M=2048,N=4096,K=11008,bf16 ONLY. Every other (arch | shape | unvalidated) request is a miss.

